sequenceDiagram
    participant ZED2 as ZED2相机
    participant Orin as Jetson Orin Nano
    participant PC as PC
    participant RTABMAP as rtabmap
    participant Listener as robot_position_listener

    ZED2->>Orin: 采集图像数据
    Orin->>Orin: stereo_sync处理
    Orin->>Orin: stereo_odometry计算
    Orin->>Orin: convert_image_format转换
    Orin->>Orin: image_transport(compress)压缩
    Orin->>PC: 发送压缩图像
    PC->>PC: image_transport(decompress)解压
    PC->>RTABMAP: 发送图像数据
    RTABMAP->>Listener: 发布定位结果
    Listener->>PC: 位置监听与反馈

